  "meta_description": "Built-in bra tank with front support, no band.",
  "description_html": "<p>Our first tank top with real built-in bra support. No wires, no extra layers, no lines showing through your clothes. One piece that does it all. Features <strong>removable padding </strong>for customisable coverage and <strong>a smoothing sculpt fit </strong>that defines your shape without squeezing. Works for everything from <strong>lounging to errands to the office</strong>. Comfortable enough to forget you're wearing it.</p><p><strong>Simple Care for High Performance:</strong></p><ul><li>Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle.</li><li>Use a machine wash bag to protect the garment.</li><li>Line dry only.</li><li>Do not bleach, iron, or dry clean.</li></ul>",
